[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14462.229, "timestamp": "04:01:02", "text": "回来，我想，我就像，兄弟，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14464.95, "timestamp": "04:01:04", "text": "如果我能回到过去，我一定会非常高兴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14470.95, "timestamp": "04:01:10", "text": "和过去的自己啪啪啪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14474.07, "timestamp": "04:01:14", "text": "然后就会想：“这到底是怎么回事？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14480.241, "timestamp": "04:01:20", "text": "[倒吸一口气]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14481.51, "timestamp": "04:01:21", "text": "[哭泣]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14486.55, "timestamp": "04:01:26", "text": "听起来像是那个战斗版本的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14489.83, "timestamp": "04:01:29", "text": "咖啡意面。啊，你看，现在的问题是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14493.91, "timestamp": "04:01:33", "text": "太沉迷于这种语言了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14496.79, "timestamp": "04:01:36", "text": "以前"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14499.429, "timestamp": "04:01:39", "text": "没有人回应。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14502.87, "timestamp": "04:01:42", "text": "天。好的。好的。每个人都喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14505.269, "timestamp": "04:01:45", "text": "是的，慢跑，那就是你的身份，我们都知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14507.269, "timestamp": "04:01:47", "text": "为此我们不希望你停止。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14509.59, "timestamp": "04:01:49", "text": "说着，我告诉笨蛋这件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14512.63, "timestamp": "04:01:52", "text": "这就是为什么我们都知道你是个运动健将。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14515.51, "timestamp": "04:01:55", "text": "lang jock lingo this and that all the"}]